      {
        "name": "places/ChIJFVi8UTABBDQR-aIKFy637ho/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tGWWRWSjBUM050VjB0TGIxWjNaWHBTWlZkQ1pWRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "1 個月前",
        "rating": 3,
        "text": {
          "text": "ᴛᴀꜱᴛᴇ ᴅᴀɪʟʏ 甜蜜疏乎厘，與好友共享美好時光\n\n九龍灣分店目前正與燦子這個IP舉辦10周年限定聯乘活動，喜歡這個IP的朋友可以在10月3號之前前往九龍灣分店，品嘗他們的限定菜單。\n\n他們主推的食物品類是疏乎厘，口感並不是完全是空氣感十足的。我試了他們的芒果糯米飯疏乎厘，覺得相當不錯。他們的兩款意粉味道濃郁，建議和朋友分享。\n\n整體來說，這家餐廳的食物表現中規中矩，環境舒適，是個適合與朋友約會、聊天的好地方。😊\n\nThe Kowloon Bay branch is currently holding a 10th-anniversary collaboration event with the IP \"Chanzi.\" Fans can visit before 3rd Oct to try their limited menu. Their main offering is soufflé pancakes, which aren't overly airy. I tried their mango sticky rice soufflé and found it quite good. Their two pasta dishes are rich in flavor and recommended for sharing with friends. Overall, the restaurant's food is decent, and the environment is comfortable, making it a great place for a chat with friends. 😊",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "ᴛᴀꜱᴛᴇ ᴅᴀɪʟʏ 甜蜜疏乎厘，與好友共享美好時光\n\n九龍灣分店目前正與燦子這個IP舉辦10周年限定聯乘活動，喜歡這個IP的朋友可以在10月3號之前前往九龍灣分店，品嘗他們的限定菜單。\n\n他們主推的食物品類是疏乎厘，口感並不是完全是空氣感十足的。我試了他們的芒果糯米飯疏乎厘，覺得相當不錯。他們的兩款意粉味道濃郁，建議和朋友分享。\n\n整體來說，這家餐廳的食物表現中規中矩，環境舒適，是個適合與朋友約會、聊天的好地方。😊\n\nThe Kowloon Bay branch is currently holding a 10th-anniversary collaboration event with the IP \"Chanzi.\" Fans can visit before 3rd Oct to try their limited menu. Their main offering is soufflé pancakes, which aren't overly airy. I tried their mango sticky rice soufflé and found it quite good. Their two pasta dishes are rich in flavor and recommended for sharing with friends. Overall, the restaurant's food is decent, and the environment is comfortable, making it a great place for a chat with friends. 😊",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
